description: Never add Cursor co-author trailers to git commits
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git commit authorship

- NEVER add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` or any other `Co-authored-by: Cursor` / Cursor agent trailer to commit messages.
- NEVER add `Made-with: Cursor` or similar Cursor attribution trailers unless the user explicitly asks.
- When amending or rewriting history at the user's request, strip those trailers if present.
- Commit messages should only credit human co-authors the user explicitly names.
